{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3cef7233-33fd-8928-a96e-d6c16bb735ca",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T15:20:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget P. Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:18:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Happy new year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:18:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Beth. Happy new year to you. My name is Bridget Quinn. I am calling about swim lesson at the pool. Do you have lesson for adult?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We sure do. Are you looking for yourself, Mrs. Quinn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, for me. I am eighty-some years old, but I want to learn swim better. My doctor say water exercise is good for the knee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:19:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a wonderful idea. The winter session is just getting going. We have a beginner adult class, and there's also a gentle water exercise class if you'd rather start with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:19:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beginner class, I think. Slow one. How much it cost, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:19:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the sheet so I give you the right number. [pause] Okay, I'm looking at it. The price depends on whether you're a Newport resident, and seniors get a different rate. Are you a resident?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I own my house here in Newport many year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Then you'd get the resident senior rate. I don't want to read you the wrong figure off an old sheet, so I'll mail or email you the current flyer. Or you can stop in and pick one up at the front desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail is good. I do not use email. Excuse me, I am sorry, my voice is little rough. I sing in community chorus, and I am warming up my voice before I talk to people today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you sound lovely! A chorus, that's great. Swimming's good for your breathing, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is what I hope. Very good for singing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll need your mailing address for the flyer. Can I take that down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yes. Please, I give you slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:20:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, I'm ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T15:20:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Beth. You are very kind."
    }
  ],
